          "type": "text",
          "text": "A 200 km delivery route consists of three travelling stages and a 30-minute loading stop. The first stage is x km long and is travelled at 40 km/h. The second stage is 20 km longer than the first and is travelled at 60 km/h. The remaining distance is travelled at 80 km/h. The average speed for the complete route, including the stop, is 50 km/h. Find x."
        }
      ],
      "marks": 5,
      "primary_outcome": "4.3",
      "secondary_outcomes": [],
      "response": {
