          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Use the overall average speed to find the total elapsed time and subtract the loading stop to obtain the total travelling time."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "stage": 2,
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The three stage distances are x, x + 20 and 180 - 2x kilometres. Their travel times add to 3.5 hours."
